Cole’s motorcycle form has three exact speed advantages.

Its base-speed amplifier is +0.5×, meaning its normal tiered base pace is 1.5× the normal base pace.

Its standard boost multiplier is 1.8× instead of the normal 1.5×.

Its ultimate multiplier is 2.3× instead of the normal 2.0×.

